; Settled. Winning 42, Ch. 10, p. 83 (S-0113-b).
; Claim, in our words: scored by marks, a hand is over the moment the bid is
; made or set: a 30 made by the third trick, a set on the fourth. The rest of
; the play changes no mark.
; Reading: the declaring side has banked its threshold (to-make 0), or the
; other side the points that set it (to-set 0). The solved outcomes answer a
; settled hand at once, without search (README, Solved outcomes). In Hand 29
; the setters' 16 on the first trick set the 30; in Hand 32 the 3-3's trick
; sets the 36.

(query
  (or (to-make 0) (to-set 0)))
